{"id":"n25386-1-8","stage":5,"title":"고다 · 炖","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25386-1-8-1","ko":"삼계탕은 어떤 요리인가요?","zh":"参鸡汤是什么菜？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼계탕은","meaning":"参鸡汤","explanation":"삼계탕：参鸡汤；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"삼계탕","audio":"/audio/b7d82f76f0f888475dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14582","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼계탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요리인가요?","meaning":"菜，菜肴，料理","explanation":"요리：菜，菜肴，料理；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"2","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b7d82f76f0f88847","term":"삼계탕","zh":"参鸡汤","audio":"/audio/b7d82f76f0f888475dbd.mp3","entryId":"14582","definition":"童子鸡里放进人参、糯米、大枣等而煮得烂熟的食物。","pronunciation":["삼계탕","삼게탕"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"aa664b105a07ea19","term":"요리","zh":"菜，菜肴，料理","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3","entryId":"30199","definition":"经过烹调好的食物。","pronunciation":["요리"]}],"audio":"/audio/0568a3550b3b9f081024.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25386-1-8-2","ko":"삼계탕은 닭을 고아 요리한 음식이에요.","zh":"参鸡汤是把鸡炖煮而成的一道菜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼계탕은","meaning":"参鸡汤","explanation":"삼계탕：参鸡汤；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"삼계탕","audio":"/audio/b7d82f76f0f888475dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14582","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼계탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닭을","meaning":"鸡","explanation":"닭：鸡；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"닭","audio":"/audio/82e5449c632286a1c5e5.mp3"}],"sour